hakios-device-duchamp -- the POCO X6 Pro 5G (duchamp, MediaTek Dimensity 8300 Ultra / MT6897) for HakiOS

Licenses
  The kernel side (XNU drivers, Apple Public Source License 2.0) lives in its own repository,
                 github.com/TheFormidable/hakios-xnu-duchamp.
  everything else  MIT (LICENSE).

Derived from: hakios-mt6768 (github.com/oosexgang/hakios-mt6768, MIT) -- mtkloader/ and tools/ are its loader and scripts,
carried over to this phone; the changes are said at the top of each file.

Third-party code: none is copied into this repository. Register addresses were read from public sources, named where used:
  - the MT6897 device tree and dtbo LineageOS ships for this phone (github.com/mt6897-devs/device_xiaomi_duchamp-kernel)
    and its BoardConfig (github.com/mt6897-devs/device_xiaomi_duchamp) -- numbers read, nothing copied;
  - MediaTek's Linux drivers (mediatek-drm's atag,videolfb; Linux's fs/pstore/ram.c zone layout) -- GPL-2.0; read, not copied.

Not in this repository, by design (LEGAL.md): any file of iOS, any vendor firmware (pulled from the user's own phone by
pull-firmware.sh), any image or device tree of the phone, any screenshot.
